# lucene-rust's own test dictionary: parser corners -- a BOM, CRLF lines,
# FLAG UTF-8 in a UTF-8 file, empty KEY groups and AF values, IGNORE in
# affixes, BREAK patterns, escaped slashes, astral suffixes, phonetic
# entries under LANG de.
SET UTF-8
FLAG UTF-8
LANG de_DE
IGNORE x
KEY qwe|asd||
BREAK 3
BREAK -$
BREAK ^-
BREAK --
AF 3
AF
AF AB
AF É

SFX A Y 2
SFX A 0 0/3 .
SFX A 0 sx .

SFX B Y 1
SFX B 0 𝒜 .

SFX É Y 1
SFX É 0 en .
